<title>USA: Big Sandy ISD, Texas, won by Prudential Sec..</title>
<headline>Big Sandy ISD, Texas, won by Prudential Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $3 million of Big Sandy ISD, Texas, schoolhouse bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.3588 percent.</p>
</text>
